Keep the text of a selected item readable in Dolphin

The item view of Dolphin paints its own item text over the selection
pill that the style draws. A colour scheme can give the text colour
and the selection colour almost the same luminance. The style then
paints an opaque pill, and the text on the pill has no contrast.

The style now walks the widget parents at PE_PanelItemViewItem and
looks for the Dolphin viewport class KItemListContainerViewport. For
a selected item in that view, the style measures the contrast ratio
of the text colour against the opaque selection colour. When the
ratio is below 1.6, the style paints the pill with an alpha of 0.32.
Under the pointer the alpha is 0.40. The view background then shows
through the pill, and the text keeps the contrast that the scheme
gives it against the view background. The two alpha values are the
values that Dolphin uses for its own Breeze selection rectangle. The
1.6 floor is the lowest ratio at which the text stays legible. The
translucent pill keeps the same alpha in an inactive window.

The Qt 5 style tests QPalette::HighlightedText, because a Qt 5 build
of Dolphin draws the text of a selected item with that role. The Qt 6
style tests QPalette::Text, because Dolphin now draws the text of a
selected item with the normal text role. Item views outside the
Dolphin viewport keep the opaque pill.

The change sits on the branch dolphin-selected-item-text of the local
tree. The fork wyn/qtcurve holds that branch. Merge request !28 on
system/qtcurve holds that branch.

Drop this patch when upstream merges the change.

diff --git a/qt5/style/qtcurve_primitive.cpp b/qt5/style/qtcurve_primitive.cpp
index d9bd519..7293795 100644
--- a/qt5/style/qtcurve_primitive.cpp
+++ b/qt5/style/qtcurve_primitive.cpp
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
  *****************************************************************************/
 
 #include "qtcurve_p.h"
+#include <qtcurve-utils/color.h>
 #include <qtcurve-utils/qtprops.h>
 
 #include <QMdiSubWindow>
@@ -31,6 +32,7 @@
 #include <QListView>
 #include <QPixmapCache>
 #include <QDockWidget>
+#include <QGraphicsView>
 #include <QGroupBox>
 #include <QDial>
 #include <QCheckBox>
@@ -774,6 +776,24 @@ Style::drawPrimitiveQtcBackground(PrimitiveElement,
     return true;
 }
 
+static const double qtcItemTextMinContrast = 1.6;
+static const qreal qtcDolphinSelectedPillAlpha = 0.32;
+static const qreal qtcDolphinPointerPillAlpha = 0.40;
+
+static inline bool
+qtcItemTextContrastsOnColor(const QPalette &palette,
+                            QPalette::ColorGroup cg,
+                            QPalette::ColorRole textRole,
+                            const QColor &background)
+{
+    const QColor textColor = palette.color(cg, textRole);
+    const double textLuma = qtcColorLuma(&textColor);
+    const double backgroundLuma = qtcColorLuma(&background);
+    const double high = textLuma > backgroundLuma ? textLuma : backgroundLuma;
+    const double low = textLuma < backgroundLuma ? textLuma : backgroundLuma;
+    return (high + 0.05) / (low + 0.05) >= qtcItemTextMinContrast;
+}
+
 bool
 Style::drawPrimitivePanelItemViewItem(PrimitiveElement,
                                       const QStyleOption *option,
@@ -832,16 +852,31 @@ Style::drawPrimitivePanelItemViewItem(PrimitiveElement,
                            QListView::IconMode)))));
         bool modAlpha = (!(state & State_Active) &&
                          m_inactiveChangeSelectionColor);
+        const QWidget *dolphinViewport = widget;
+        while (dolphinViewport &&
+               !dolphinViewport->inherits("KItemListContainerViewport")) {
+            dolphinViewport = dolphinViewport->parentWidget();
+        }
+        const bool dolphinItemList = dolphinViewport &&
+            qobject_cast<const QGraphicsView*>(dolphinViewport);
+        const bool dolphinTextPill = dolphinItemList &&
+            (state & State_Selected) &&
+            !qtcItemTextContrastsOnColor(palette, cg,
+                                         QPalette::HighlightedText, color);
         if (hover && !hasCustomBackground) {
             if (!(state & State_Selected)) {
                 color.setAlphaF(theThemedApp == APP_PLASMA && !widget ?
                                 0.5 * (modAlpha ? 0.75 : 1.0) : 0.20);
+            } else if (dolphinTextPill) {
+                color.setAlphaF(qtcDolphinPointerPillAlpha);
             } else {
                 color = color.lighter(110);
                 if (modAlpha) {
                     color.setAlphaF(INACTIVE_SEL_ALPHA);
                 }
             }
+        } else if (dolphinTextPill) {
+            color.setAlphaF(qtcDolphinSelectedPillAlpha);
         } else if (modAlpha) {
             color.setAlphaF(color.alphaF() * INACTIVE_SEL_ALPHA);
         }
